Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比 把球捡给我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:06.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐 别怕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.77,0:01:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X-SE01型
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王陛下下令
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.11,0:01:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要把你带往改造工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:33.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.85,0:01:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.26,0:01:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 就算剩你一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.86,0:01:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要逃走喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要跟妈妈在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:05.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.51,0:02:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.18,0:02:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把T-01 02
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带往改造工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.63,0:02:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 你要逃出去喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.07,0:03:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,T-02
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,T-02 站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:11.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:20.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖 坐下…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的宠物机器狗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱唷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 握手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,握手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:51.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,握手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.45,0:03:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:03:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是我爸爸的公司
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新发售的机器狗皮皮喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.97,0:04:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 好好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.90,0:04:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 好羡慕你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我还是比较喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器无尾熊耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用说当然是机器狮子喽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:23.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是喜欢比较厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我的话 我喜欢…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.75,0:04:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得大雄很适合青蛙耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:30.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青蛙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你喜欢什么呀 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确是大雄会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就叫你的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮你买机器水母好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:04:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 我想要宠物…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过了不能养宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:08.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是宠物机…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你不是已经
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有宠物机了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:17.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是宠物机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说不行就是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快去写你的功课
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.81,0:05:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是叫哆啦A梦给我好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.25,0:05:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宠物机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是已经有我这一只
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器猫了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.89,0:05:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本就不像宠物嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一点都不听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么能算是你的主人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是泄气耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了要让你成为
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个成熟的大人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我特地从22世纪来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果什么事情都听你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哪敢听你的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:54.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要了解我的苦心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又开始说教了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要搞清楚喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:06:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是自动贩卖机喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 让开…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在忙得很呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是大雄太任性了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才耽误了一点时间…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.74,0:06:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是忙着跟小咪约会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的空间袋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要抓了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痒好痒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要抓了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定是大雄做的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把我的空间袋…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:07:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空间袋…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.55,0:07:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来百货公司邮购机
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢您的惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请订购您所需要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人的目录…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:25.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.67,0:07:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:31.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有没有水母机器人…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停不下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:38.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么搞的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便按好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,订购键
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢您的订购…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢您的订购…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《大雄与机器人王国》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.48,0:09:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.18,0:09:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,楼上是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是太荣幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天能够跟您认识
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.66,0:10:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是挖地瓜机器人康助
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问您有地瓜要挖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们全都给我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.71,0:10:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:27.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小咪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.65,0:10:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见喽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是滚筒机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么会在这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,街上全部都是机器人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.21,0:11:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说这又是大雄的杰作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.25,0:11:04.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便乱丢垃圾…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要罚一千块
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便乱丢垃圾…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千块
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁快来赶走它呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.99,0:11:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快走开啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要罚一千块…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:21.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是罚钱箱耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.57,0:11:26.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 不要这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底做了什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:41.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖地瓜呀挖地瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.39,0:11:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖地瓜呀挖地瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿咻嘿咻…挖地瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.66,0:11:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖地瓜机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也需要挖地瓜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讨厌打针啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.14,0:11:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打针…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.81,0:12:05.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的皮皮变成了猫了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.66,0:12:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些机器人全都是你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.80,0:12:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟未来百货公司订来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的零用钱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.68,0:12:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就付不起嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么办哪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要赶快退货才行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退货机
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就可以退货了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖地瓜…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罚钱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.93,0:12:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我下来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.73,0:13:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定 是哆啦A梦的道具害的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是大雄那个臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:28.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次把我们害惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是把我给吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把我的皮皮恢复原状啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.57,0:13:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我太不小心了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明就是一条狗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然喵喵叫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死人了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 不要这样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛喔 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.43,0:13:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你快点想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.99,0:14:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它根本就不听我的话呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.05,0:14:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.69,0:14:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点拿什么道具出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦 我找找看啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.57,0:14:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快点爬到水泥管上面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.31,0:14:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是担心这个的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:21.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:26.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作一点哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个孩子是机器人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也是被你 叫出来的机器人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:35.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.09,0:15:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有可能喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 真的很奇怪耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么只有这个机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有办法退货呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来查查看喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:47.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,壁纸秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了避人耳目
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就在这里面进行好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.05,0:16:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说没错是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.99,0:16:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不是这个地球的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦也没有办法修理喽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他身上的零件
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是我没有看过的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.43,0:16:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,材质也不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是在某个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被制造出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.13,0:16:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为什么会跑来地球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.07,0:16:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想一定是我胡搞瞎搞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会把他弄到地球上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:26.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全都是你不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要振作一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:36.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不快点想办法的话 就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就快点想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.05,0:16:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么办法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.69,0:16:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么做呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来只好把这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带回去他原来的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.76,0:16:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是不知道在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是在遥远的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要冒险的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最在行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.97,0:16:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:59.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也许会碰到很多危险喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:02.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们能够救这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不要再啰哩巴嗦的了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:05.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:07.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追根究底来说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全都是你的皮皮害的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去就是了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:14.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 就这么决定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们大家一起把这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送回去他的星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代替全宇宙的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.90,0:17:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向你们几位致谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.20,0:17:31.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我们出发喽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个时间与空间导航
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.49,0:17:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以帮助我们找到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.49,0:17:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这孩子来的时候的路线
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个机器
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.49,0:17:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在结草虫式的睡袋里头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非常安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:58.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提起精神来啊 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.77,0:18:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是有很多机器人的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.90,0:18:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定你可以要一个回来喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的也是喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们即将要进入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时空迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.51,0:18:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上就要进入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时空的迷宫里了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位一定要抓稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.53,0:18:31.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 千万不能放手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.58,0:18:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看样子好像稳定下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.35,0:18:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会不会迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前仍在继续导航中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是穿过这里去到地球的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逮捕未处理的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有人在看着我耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快抓紧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.09,0:19:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:38.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.43,0:19:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先逃了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.90,0:19:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不用你提醒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我们撞上了时空墙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.15,0:19:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不用说…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.29,0:20:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要来的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.83,0:20:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛为了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来路不明的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.63,0:20:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么卖命嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自动操纵装置故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁赶紧去抓紧操纵杆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.23,0:20:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是时空洞耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好比时空中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.77,0:20:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,产生的小型台风一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是撞上时空洞的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.47,0:20:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就完蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意前方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:20:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁赶紧去握紧操纵杆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我来做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是做得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.26,0:21:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 这里就交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.91,0:21:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操纵杆就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.41,0:21:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.43,0:21:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经顺利到达
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目的地第二世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束声音导航
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.17,0:22:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.24,0:22:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 慢慢的往后退…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.66,0:22:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是好险喔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.97,0:23:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.47,0:23:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.78,0:23:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.98,0:23:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.32,0:23:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是那个孩子的世界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方果然不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.74,0:23:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.94,0:23:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要跑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.84,0:23:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.95,0:23:49.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有房子耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.15,0:23:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 这里有房子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.12,0:23:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.62,0:23:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵吵闹闹的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.42,0:23:56.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.42,0:23:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:24:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是什么可疑的人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.43,0:24:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.43,0:24:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.76,0:24:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来不太像可疑的人 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.17,0:24:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.64,0:24:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的机器人助手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.54,0:24:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫克鲁林
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.67,0:24:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.88,0:24:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是稀客啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.81,0:24:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫欧拿贝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这个管家机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是拥有一级证书的呦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.42,0:24:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.79,0:24:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是三级机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.22,0:24:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做查贝克 是个人类
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.86,0:24:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是机器人的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.66,0:24:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是太好了耶 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:39.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.63,0:24:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.93,0:24:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个人类
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.20,0:24:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实…我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.31,0:24:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.64,0:24:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我从来没听过的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.91,0:24:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他送到那儿去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.61,0:24:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我的实验
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.08,0:24:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现了意外的状况…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.15,0:25:00.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么样的实验
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.32,0:25:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.26,0:25:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个别碰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.99,0:25:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.16,0:25:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是动到了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.10,0:25:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是刚才那只鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.97,0:25:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个传送机好巧不巧的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.84,0:25:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那个孩子送到超空间里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.61,0:25:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好跟你们的机器 连结在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.25,0:25:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查贝克博士的实验
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.02,0:25:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就没有用 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.68,0:25:33.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话可不能这么说喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.49,0:25:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人跟人类
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.85,0:25:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起在这个星球上生活
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.49,0:25:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.56,0:25:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.99,0:25:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.89,0:25:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那个机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.03,0:25:43.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要追我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.86,0:25:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.40,0:25:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 饭菜都准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.67,0:25:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的肚子快要饿扁了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.24,0:25:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的肚子不像是扁的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.68,0:25:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家别客气 尽量吃
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.54,0:25:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧拿贝可是料理铁人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.88,0:26:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧拿贝本来就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.71,0:26:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.88,0:26:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们太抬举我了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.32,0:26:09.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我要开动喽
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.99,0:26:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.20,0:26:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.66,0:26:17.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超赞的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.70,0:26:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我这辈子吃过
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.17,0:26:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好吃的东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.07,0:26:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你平常都是吃什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.90,0:26:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.90,0:26:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.07,0:26:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然大家这么喜欢我的菜
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.84,0:26:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就端出我的拿手点心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.31,0:26:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.34,0:26:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好期待喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.75,0:26:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 这可是相当新鲜的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.72,0:26:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请享用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.10,0:26:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球是个开拓星
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.27,0:26:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是开拓星啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.80,0:26:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开拓星
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.77,0:26:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是开拓没有人住过的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.00,0:26:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建造一个新的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.07,0:27:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.24,0:27:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开自己的星球故乡
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.04,0:27:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,踏上这个星球的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.31,0:27:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比人类还要多
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.74,0:27:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类对待机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.74,0:27:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是自己的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及谈天的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.28,0:27:39.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人的人工智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.28,0:27:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也急速进化
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.28,0:27:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于和人类一样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.42,0:27:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有同样的心与感情
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.82,0:27:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.26,0:27:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却把机器人当做是奴隶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.99,0:27:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们变成了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.50,0:28:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只听从人类 的忠实道具来使唤
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.50,0:28:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是她的机器人改造计划
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人改造计划
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.87,0:28:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.04,0:28:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太无法无天了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.31,0:28:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 真是可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.13,0:28:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔司令官
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.20,0:28:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捕捉机器人的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.20,0:28:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行得怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.17,0:28:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王 您不需要担心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.20,0:28:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切都交给我来处理
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.71,0:28:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的部下多洛伊德兵
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.04,0:28:44.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经顺利的在进行
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.68,0:28:46.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且成果卓著
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.68,0:29:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您为什么唯独 不改造玛莉亚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.02,0:29:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是您的养育机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.99,0:29:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您可千万别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.52,0:29:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的父王是怎么死的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.16,0:29:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是因为把机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.86,0:29:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也当做是人类才会…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.76,0:29:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.60,0:29:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人只不过 是人类的道具罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.98,0:29:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.18,0:29:58.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.40,0:30:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,均KA
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.64,0:30:18.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经醒过来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.94,0:30:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.24,0:30:21.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.71,0:30:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.44,0:30:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.54,0:30:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是波克
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.51,0:30:28.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.05,0:30:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的身体还没有恢复呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.25,0:30:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.15,0:30:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈 被多洛伊德兵给抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.02,0:30:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去救她
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.32,0:30:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.03,0:30:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.36,0:30:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.46,0:30:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人根本就没有办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.80,0:30:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.47,0:30:47.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.17,0:30:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查贝克博士
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.67,0:30:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太逞强了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.27,0:30:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体都还没完全恢复呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.84,0:30:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怜喔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.68,0:30:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说波克的妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.78,0:31:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很可能被改造了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.12,0:31:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.18,0:31:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.07,0:31:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.01,0:31:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.51,0:31:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.64,0:31:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.51,0:31:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克他怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.48,0:31:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我变成怎么样都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.31,0:31:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 请您放过波克吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.75,0:31:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我求求您
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.48,0:31:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.52,0:31:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.89,0:31:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您做错了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.99,0:31:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您怎么可以
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.09,0:31:46.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把机器人 当做是唯一的道具呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.49,0:31:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您快觉醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.83,0:31:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.80,0:31:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个机器人 竟敢命令人类…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.17,0:31:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.23,0:31:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.84,0:32:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个房间不准任何人进去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.08,0:32:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉亚还有波克
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.81,0:32:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得先除掉这两个人才行…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.96,0:32:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.59,0:32:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.43,0:32:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.20,0:32:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.16,0:32:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.36,0:32:25.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.03,0:32:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是X-01型的工作机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.84,0:32:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请主人尽量交代工作
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.77,0:32:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快点来玩球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.44,0:32:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要丢喽
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.11,0:32:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.85,0:32:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是X-01型的工作机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.49,0:32:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请主人尽量交代工作
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.32,0:32:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.62,0:32:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比他…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.16,0:32:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.86,0:32:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.83,0:33:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都找不到人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.80,0:33:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会跑到什么地方去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.50,0:33:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.14,0:33:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定是去找他的妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.00,0:33:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.34,0:33:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有可能是跑去宫殿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.81,0:33:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能不管他
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.88,0:33:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连波克都会被抓去改造的…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.31,0:33:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要快去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.95,0:33:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让克鲁林帮你们带路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.18,0:33:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.42,0:33:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.32,0:33:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这一身打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.49,0:33:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会引起别人的怀疑的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.46,0:33:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换装照相机
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.33,0:33:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.83,0:33:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.50,0:33:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.10,0:34:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.07,0:34:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.94,0:34:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是F-01女佣型机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.22,0:34:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现未处理的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.87,0:35:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 他在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.33,0:35:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.30,0:35:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有什么武器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.94,0:35:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的道具全部都掉了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.71,0:35:23.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延长手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.11,0:35:25.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.11,0:35:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.72,0:35:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.75,0:35:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.89,0:35:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.82,0:35:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.69,0:35:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.66,0:35:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.26,0:35:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去的话太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.97,0:35:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都可能会被抓走的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.87,0:35:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.22,0:36:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.26,0:36:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.53,0:36:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.39,0:36:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以这么野蛮嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.36,0:36:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.37,0:36:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.21,0:36:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.14,0:36:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.44,0:36:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是这个星球的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.88,0:36:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是从哪来的狸型机器人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.78,0:36:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是狸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.18,0:36:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个猫型机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.02,0:36:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟敢这么放肆
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.19,0:36:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.42,0:36:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过是人类 忠实的道具罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.43,0:36:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我听好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.70,0:36:51.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是从地球来的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.26,0:36:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的话根本就不算数
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.77,0:36:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.17,0:36:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听都没听过
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.90,0:36:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来可能是银河的尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.17,0:37:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小的像尘土的星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.04,0:37:02.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.48,0:37:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球比你们这个星球 还要漂亮多了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.75,0:37:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.11,0:37:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒想试试
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.42,0:37:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个从什么地球来的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.78,0:37:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人性能如何
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.82,0:37:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.36,0:37:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把他关进大牢里去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.49,0:37:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我回来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.96,0:37:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.63,0:37:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.83,0:37:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.10,0:37:30.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底要对我怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.84,0:37:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是从地球来的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.77,0:37:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.94,0:37:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们对我要客气一点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.25,0:37:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.71,0:37:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.58,0:37:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.32,0:37:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.35,0:37:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.35,0:37:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在地球出生的猫型机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.32,0:37:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本就不是他们说的狸啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.99,0:37:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.73,0:37:55.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你是波克的…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.36,0:37:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说波克
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.46,0:37:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道波克他的下落是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.33,0:38:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个孩子他平安无事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.87,0:38:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.40,0:38:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.97,0:38:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.01,0:38:09.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是吓我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.01,0:38:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.36,0:38:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.56,0:38:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德姆国王
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.06,0:39:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让人类跟机器人同心协力
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.33,0:39:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要把这个星球建造成一个 丰富的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.43,0:39:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王在很小的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.50,0:39:12.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母亲就过世了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.50,0:39:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.54,0:39:15.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就负责照顾珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.67,0:39:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也成了波克的玩伴
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.68,0:39:20.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人是一起长大的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.71,0:39:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德姆国王
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.25,0:39:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为了开垦荒芜的大地
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.98,0:39:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲自带头指挥开拓的工程
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.54,0:39:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.74,0:39:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到却招来了不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.15,0:39:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险哪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.76,0:40:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.76,0:40:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.56,0:40:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.26,0:40:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.74,0:40:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下过世之后
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.81,0:40:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王继承了王位
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.55,0:40:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却听信邪恶司令官 铁斯塔的话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.42,0:40:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全都是机器人害的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.56,0:40:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为他们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.56,0:40:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有跟人类一样的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.69,0:40:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.83,0:40:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会舍身救他们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.59,0:40:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.83,0:40:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像变了个人似的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.50,0:40:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下令改造机器人…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.03,0:40:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是因为父亲的死
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.90,0:40:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让她过于哀伤
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.44,0:40:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是她能够 醒悟过来就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.42,0:41:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.92,0:41:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.05,0:41:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.45,0:41:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了啦 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.46,0:41:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.46,0:41:13.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了啦 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.49,0:41:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 怎么了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.19,0:41:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.13,0:41:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像要参加钢铁对战耶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.66,0:41:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.03,0:41:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钢铁对战
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.63,0:41:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.17,0:41:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们让机器人彼此战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.24,0:41:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.11,0:41:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.51,0:41:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.34,0:41:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.84,0:41:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点帮我们带路
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.27,0:41:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.97,0:41:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.54,0:42:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.27,0:42:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的比赛是佛克斯A获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.84,0:42:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输的话要被当成废铁处理帕
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.41,0:42:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.38,0:42:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.11,0:42:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可恶了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.42,0:42:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快点看那里
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.22,0:42:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是珍娜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.62,0:42:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在她旁边的就是铁斯塔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.19,0:42:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.39,0:42:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一场比赛会很精彩喔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.27,0:42:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来的赛程是…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.54,0:42:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从遥远的银河边界来的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.17,0:42:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.74,0:42:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.51,0:42:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.78,0:42:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很痛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.64,0:42:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.61,0:42:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.02,0:42:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底要干什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.15,0:42:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.25,0:42:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在出去太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.69,0:42:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要伺机而动
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.69,0:42:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的对手是金刚费达
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.30,0:42:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对战300回合以来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.76,0:43:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无败绩的战士
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.40,0:43:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎 金刚费达
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.67,0:43:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦打不赢他的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.58,0:43:12.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他手上也没有武器
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.74,0:43:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先别急
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.68,0:43:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大只喔
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.99,0:43:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚铁对战 比赛开始
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.36,0:43:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武士是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.76,0:43:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.52,0:44:01.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么武器啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.39,0:44:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.00,0:44:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,定时笨蛋炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.90,0:44:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间设定为五秒
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.75,0:44:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.22,0:44:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大头大头下雨不用愁
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.26,0:44:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦激怒金刚的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.29,0:44:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是定时笨蛋炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.56,0:44:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然瞧不起我 跳起舞来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.23,0:44:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.50,0:44:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个笨蛋 跳够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.41,0:44:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么武器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.91,0:44:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实物影印机
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.32,0:45:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.53,0:45:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.86,0:45:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.89,0:45:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先打旁边的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.38,0:45:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要几个就有几个
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.69,0:45:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 做得好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.55,0:45:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会上当的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.56,0:45:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一口气把你们解决
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.34,0:45:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.41,0:46:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看还有什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.75,0:46:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逗人笑跳蚤
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.11,0:46:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逗人笑跳蚤跑到我的身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.67,0:46:31.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然又跳又笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.24,0:46:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑子有问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.85,0:46:35.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.55,0:46:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.38,0:46:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.84,0:47:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.79,0:47:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.69,0:47:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,优胜者是地球来的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.93,0:47:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.16,0:47:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.36,0:47:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.87,0:47:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.93,0:47:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 好厉害唷
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.94,0:47:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有你的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.37,0:47:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金刚先生
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.31,0:47:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实真正厉害的人是你哟
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.61,0:47:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.38,0:47:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.68,0:47:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耍了一点小小的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.82,0:47:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.35,0:47:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的很聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.22,0:47:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我输了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.45,0:47:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没出息
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.82,0:47:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因为那些 没用的感情做祟
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.56,0:47:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.63,0:47:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请立刻下改造令吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.36,0:47:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.63,0:47:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在立刻把金刚 带到改造工厂去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.73,0:48:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求您 不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.60,0:48:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.70,0:48:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求您饶过我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.51,0:48:09.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 现在机会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.44,0:48:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.38,0:48:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.58,0:48:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在赶快逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.55,0:48:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不快把金刚带走
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.48,0:48:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.55,0:48:21.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快回来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.35,0:48:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.02,0:48:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这么做真是太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.06,0:48:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然任意夺走机器人的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.56,0:48:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人只要当个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.93,0:48:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺从人类的道具就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.40,0:48:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.40,0:48:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦他才不是道具
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.13,0:48:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.00,0:48:39.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.64,0:48:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.27,0:48:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.14,0:48:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你快点停止改造机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.94,0:48:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我妈妈还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.58,0:48:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.68,0:48:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个无礼之徒
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.18,0:48:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.45,0:48:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去把那些人抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.99,0:48:56.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.56,0:48:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 快点追啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.46,0:49:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.27,0:49:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.17,0:49:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.08,0:49:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.95,0:49:23.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管他们逃到哪去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.82,0:49:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发信器发出的电波
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.78,0:49:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都追踪得到
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.67,0:49:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.94,0:49:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克已经恢复精神了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.01,0:49:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.87,0:49:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那波克的妈妈怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.34,0:49:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好他妈妈 已经被改造了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.84,0:49:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.01,0:49:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她到现在还没有被改造喔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.75,0:50:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经见过她了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.82,0:50:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见到我妈妈了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.09,0:50:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 虽然她被关起来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.06,0:50:04.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是她还是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.62,0:50:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直很担心你的事喔
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.46,0:50:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.09,0:50:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.83,0:50:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能就这样丢着不管
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.23,0:50:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.16,0:50:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.87,0:50:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.74,0:50:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.57,0:50:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是多洛伊德兵
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.11,0:50:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.11,0:50:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们被人家跟踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.58,0:50:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁还来得及 你们快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.58,0:50:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要逃去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.28,0:50:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃往西边去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.19,0:50:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的目标是 荒野尽头的人面岩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.22,0:50:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 人面岩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.26,0:50:40.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.56,0:50:42.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家动作快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.23,0:50:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始动了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.30,0:50:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道被发现了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.20,0:50:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.80,0:50:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克跟那些人往西边走了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.14,0:50:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是您亲自率队 逮捕他的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.11,0:51:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您不快点动身的话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.71,0:51:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情会很难收拾的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.68,0:51:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.65,0:51:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这就出发
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.33,0:51:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 我的竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.93,0:51:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.23,0:51:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了 先降落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.34,0:51:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这里开始我们得用走的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.54,0:51:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.34,0:51:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就不晓得方向啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.28,0:51:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个就交给我了 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.21,0:51:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西边是…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.28,0:51:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.42,0:51:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.25,0:51:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.29,0:51:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这样往西走
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.29,0:51:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底会有什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.93,0:51:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.70,0:51:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈她常告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.50,0:51:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个叫做“虹之谷”的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.63,0:51:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虹之谷的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.37,0:52:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个故障的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.01,0:52:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飘流到某个星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.64,0:52:06.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭上的机器人跟少年
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.75,0:52:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人开始往西边旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.12,0:52:11.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚开始两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.38,0:52:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不停的有过争吵
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.32,0:52:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渐渐的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.02,0:52:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人的感情越来越好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.22,0:52:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后两个人合力建造一个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.46,0:52:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人跟人类
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.83,0:52:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和平共处的理想国
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.16,0:52:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而那个地方就叫做虹之谷
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.50,0:52:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是虹之谷的故事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.40,0:52:31.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 这只是一个故事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.74,0:52:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有水没有食物的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.74,0:52:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早就死翘翘了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.42,0:52:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的沙尘暴喔
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.52,0:52:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.36,0:52:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有什么道具啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.26,0:52:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样根本没办法前进啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.49,0:52:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.19,0:52:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点想个办法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.63,0:53:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家再加把劲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.34,0:53:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来 他们往下走了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.38,0:53:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.45,0:53:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.39,0:53:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本无法再往前一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.79,0:53:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.86,0:53:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.39,0:53:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.39,0:53:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家紧紧的靠在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.19,0:53:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.81,0:53:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.11,0:53:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.74,0:53:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好 没有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.91,0:53:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在走到查贝克博士说的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.31,0:53:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人面岩前
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.31,0:53:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家再忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.25,0:53:52.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 西边在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.88,0:53:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.75,0:53:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.42,0:53:57.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.06,0:53:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.40,0:54:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前进
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.37,0:54:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.91,0:54:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是悬崖
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.24,0:54:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好险喔
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.75,0:54:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.48,0:54:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您继续往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.96,0:54:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来 这个星球就是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.99,0:54:35.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把所有
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.76,0:54:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听从我的命令的机器人 组织起来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.46,0:54:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建造一个最强的机器人王国
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.87,0:54:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.74,0:54:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.81,0:54:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好渴喔
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.31,0:54:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不行了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.98,0:54:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.42,0:55:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.49,0:55:04.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有水龙头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.16,0:55:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的话我早就拿出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.96,0:55:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好难受喔
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.52,0:55:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.69,0:55:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.85,0:55:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一步也走不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.46,0:55:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.02,0:55:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.03,0:55:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.66,0:55:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 振作一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.93,0:55:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 西边在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.17,0:55:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.67,0:55:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.03,0:55:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.04,0:55:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.94,0:55:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是人面岩耶
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.04,0:55:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快点起来 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.94,0:56:00.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 我现在还走得动
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.01,0:56:03.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们背大家过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.18,0:56:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂时先背到山洞里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.94,0:56:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们大家分头去找水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.21,0:56:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.08,0:56:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到山洞里面去找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.21,0:56:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.75,0:56:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.41,0:56:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到下面去找水
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.58,0:56:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到上面去找
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.09,0:56:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要小心一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.16,0:57:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.96,0:57:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的水壶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.20,0:57:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.63,0:57:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好还剩下普通的水壶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.05,0:57:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.16,0:57:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点喝水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.96,0:57:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢均KA
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.07,0:58:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捡回一条命了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.47,0:58:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.04,0:58:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.34,0:58:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 他也去找水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.72,0:58:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.39,0:58:28.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换我了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.69,0:58:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个换我了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.09,0:58:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.03,0:58:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.70,0:58:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜 那我要换人喽
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.07,0:58:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 我要妈妈一直背我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.01,0:58:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.39,0:59:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种人根本别去管她的死活
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.19,0:59:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.59,0:59:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.30,0:59:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来我们该怎么做才好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.07,0:59:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么没有看到克鲁林啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.70,0:59:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到里头去了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.14,0:59:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.17,0:59:15.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.24,0:59:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到里面看看 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.87,0:59:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.38,0:59:19.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.31,0:59:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在前面 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.05,0:59:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面到底有什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.26,0:59:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种地方竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.19,0:59:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.23,0:59:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.43,0:59:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.94,0:59:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想查贝克博士说的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.21,0:59:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该就是这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.92,1:00:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.18,1:00:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.29,1:00:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.25,1:00:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问你们有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.49,1:00:08.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.79,1:00:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.63,1:00:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.36,1:00:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.30,1:00:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人不要管我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.81,1:00:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.07,1:00:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您好像受伤了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.84,1:00:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.71,1:00:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.81,1:00:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.95,1:00:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都反对 您的机器人改造计划
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.15,1:00:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就跟机器人在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.12,1:00:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起生活着
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.72,1:00:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.82,1:00:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.62,1:00:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.76,1:00:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不需要机器人…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.76,1:00:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是机器人又怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.53,1:00:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.76,1:00:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不能够暸解我的悲伤
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.27,1:00:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能够暸解
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.64,1:00:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到波克流下了眼泪耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.40,1:00:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟人类所流下来的眼泪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.24,1:00:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有哪里不同啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.77,1:00:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是波克好不容易
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.34,1:01:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才把你背到这里来的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.71,1:01:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不需要机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.40,1:01:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王已经下落不明
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.63,1:01:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据本国的法律规定
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.37,1:01:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将成为临时指导者
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.94,1:01:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人有异议吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.24,1:03:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虹之谷的故事果然是真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.91,1:03:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.01,1:03:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.55,1:03:16.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在了解我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.51,1:03:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来我父王一直以来 想做的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.38,1:03:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.89,1:03:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.05,1:03:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们去救玛莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.99,1:03:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后遵循父王的遗志
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.26,1:03:28.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建造一个理想的机器人王国
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.76,1:03:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.85,1:03:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.52,1:03:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么做 请给我们指示
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.85,1:03:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.85,1:03:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.86,1:03:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她赶出去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.86,1:04:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.53,1:04:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会遵照指示赶她出去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.24,1:04:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是珍娜女王 快点开门
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.97,1:04:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔国王下令
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.44,1:04:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你马上离开
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.34,1:04:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 铁斯塔国王
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.98,1:04:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.18,1:04:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔一开始就利用我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.52,1:04:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的目的 就是要夺取这个国家
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.39,1:04:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把你们这些机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.26,1:04:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带去改造工厂
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.96,1:04:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.69,1:04:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人改造计划 现在已经终止了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.96,1:04:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快让我跟铁斯塔见面
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.93,1:04:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类请退到一边去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.73,1:04:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把铁斯塔司令官叫出来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.87,1:04:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快让我见我的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.04,1:04:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类请退到一边去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.01,1:04:52.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果要攻击的话
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.98,1:04:54.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就攻击我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.71,1:04:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.71,1:04:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些机器人 是不会攻击人类的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.15,1:05:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.09,1:05:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群没用的废物
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.97,1:05:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.10,1:05:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在改造你之前 你就看个清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.77,1:05:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.51,1:05:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.51,1:05:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要使出最后的手段
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.18,1:06:00.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,违抗我的人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.05,1:06:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我全都要踩烂
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.18,1:06:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有想到
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.72,1:06:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城堡竟然是一个巨型机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.95,1:06:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.52,1:06:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把缩小灯拿出来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.32,1:06:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缩小灯跟放大灯一起掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.12,1:06:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.16,1:06:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我们也有一个
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.06,1:06:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨型的机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.23,1:06:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.17,1:06:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.67,1:06:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随意操纵机呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.57,1:06:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下喔
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.94,1:06:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随意操纵机…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.11,1:06:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.44,1:06:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你的竹蜻蜓里的电池
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.01,1:06:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该还有电吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.54,1:06:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.38,1:06:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.01,1:06:38.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我回来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.32,1:06:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.67,1:06:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.62,1:07:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.63,1:07:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.57,1:07:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不行了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.87,1:07:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你振作一点
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.01,1:07:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们躲到岩石下面去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.21,1:07:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想躲到哪去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.61,1:07:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.09,1:07:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.32,1:07:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 危险
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.89,1:07:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.09,1:07:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.73,1:07:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.70,1:08:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.04,1:08:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你的对手
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.91,1:08:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.48,1:08:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄跌倒了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.58,1:08:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄到底会不会操作啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.29,1:08:25.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.23,1:08:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是做暖身操的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.10,1:08:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢耍我
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.11,1:08:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在那边跳什么舞呀
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.05,1:08:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停不下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.12,1:08:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在干什么呀
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.82,1:09:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.37,1:09:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.71,1:09:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.78,1:09:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可以啦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.78,1:09:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多洛伊德宫殿…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.79,1:09:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.66,1:09:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.59,1:09:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 波克
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.40,1:09:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次应该换我去了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.60,1:09:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然没有武器我还是要去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.60,1:09:45.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家等我回来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.47,1:09:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.38,1:09:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好我有这一颗铁头
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.18,1:09:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后的武器了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.62,1:10:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的铁头功吧 铁斯塔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.62,1:10:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来喽 来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.76,1:10:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是一群笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.94,1:10:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.51,1:10:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是波克的妈妈呀
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.14,1:10:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔他人在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.08,1:10:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在你后面
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.28,1:10:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊 他躺平了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.72,1:10:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.47,1:10:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.67,1:10:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.61,1:10:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.24,1:10:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有办法控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.48,1:11:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找找看 还有什么东西可以用啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.05,1:11:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再这么下去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.39,1:11:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭会被行星吸引过去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.05,1:11:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会因此而产生冲撞
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.89,1:11:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下子糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.96,1:11:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点想办法让它停下来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.96,1:11:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.83,1:11:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影像连结起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.27,1:11:24.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.20,1:11:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.14,1:11:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.77,1:11:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.64,1:11:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.14,1:11:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.27,1:11:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在这里已经昏过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.71,1:11:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为刚才 我用我的铁头去撞了他
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.58,1:11:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.28,1:11:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在情况不妙了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.02,1:11:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.48,1:11:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这架火箭要冲撞行星 是不是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.92,1:11:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么道具可以挽救的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.92,1:11:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我全都试过了可是就是不行
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.73,1:11:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 我不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.93,1:11:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.93,1:11:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.00,1:11:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.30,1:11:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.43,1:11:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈很高兴能再看到你
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.17,1:11:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.44,1:12:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起…我…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.37,1:12:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.17,1:12:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈一直都很相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.44,1:12:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.44,1:12:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 你要保重喔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.68,1:12:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今后跟珍娜一起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.25,1:12:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同心协力的生活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.02,1:12:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.45,1:12:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈都会一直在你们身边的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.12,1:12:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.39,1:12:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你要记得写功课喔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.76,1:12:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有上学千万不要迟到
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.83,1:12:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外就算你跟胖虎小夫打架
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.47,1:12:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家也都要好好的相处
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.04,1:12:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.77,1:12:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟静香两个人都要很幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.07,1:12:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.14,1:12:38.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.48,1:12:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.71,1:12:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟妈妈说…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.05,1:12:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.05,1:12:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.78,1:12:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.65,1:12:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟妈妈说…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.65,1:12:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可以死啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.09,1:12:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们又还没有撞上去 帕
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.56,1:12:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.16,1:12:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们使用电送装置吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.30,1:13:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.36,1:13:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.80,1:13:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭以这么快的速度在移动
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.37,1:13:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是没有他们两个人 确切的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.94,1:13:09.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也是没用的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.07,1:13:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.08,1:13:14.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 是妈妈啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.08,1:13:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.88,1:13:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈在跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.51,1:13:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.32,1:13:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经知道妈妈的位置了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.60,1:13:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.90,1:13:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经快要撞上了 帕
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.20,1:13:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.04,1:13:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传送
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.91,1:13:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.06,1:14:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.56,1:14:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.79,1:14:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.80,1:14:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.13,1:14:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.13,1:14:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.44,1:14:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.17,1:14:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.24,1:14:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.44,1:14:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.31,1:14:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.88,1:14:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.26,1:14:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多罗伊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.20,1:14:40.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我把铁斯塔带回去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.83,1:14:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.83,1:14:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来 铁斯塔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.90,1:14:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔 你要彻底觉悟啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.61,1:14:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他长得跟查贝克博士好像喔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.11,1:14:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.41,1:14:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.18,1:14:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔 他正是我弟弟
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.28,1:15:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我们两个都是科学家
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.05,1:15:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过铁斯塔他却走错了路
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.93,1:15:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看 是彩虹耶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.73,1:15:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.70,1:15:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还是两道呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.14,1:15:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.58,1:15:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是您在告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.94,1:15:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要建造一个
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.88,1:15:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的虹之谷的意思吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.16,1:15:44.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们一定要回去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.46,1:15:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他们证明了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.03,1:15:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类跟机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.33,1:15:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是可以和平共处的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.03,1:15:53.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们几个还是会吵架啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.84,1:15:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.24,1:15:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的是太依赖哆啦A梦了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.97,1:15:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.91,1:16:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.68,1:16:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到波克跟妈妈这么好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.28,1:16:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不由得…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.78,1:16:05.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要回去找妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.62,1:16:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.48,1:16:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.99,1:16:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家现在都想回去找妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.99,1:16:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.26,1:16:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作不快一点的话
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.49,1:16:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳就要下山了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.26,1:16:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.36,1:16:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.86,1:16:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.00,1:16:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.87,1:16:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.08,1:16:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.08,1:16:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄啊 你怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.02,1:16:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.52,1:16:45.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊你
